# .cursor-protected
#
# Files modified by Cursor as part of the Lofty Labz production hardening effort.
# This manifest exists so future Figma Make pushes (which target `main`) can be
# three-way-merged into Cursor branches without silently overwriting hand fixes.
#
# Rules:
#   - Figma Make pushes go to `main`.
#   - Cursor work happens on feature branches (e.g. `phase-0-eject`) and PRs into `main`.
#   - When a Figma Make sync lands on `main`, diff the entries below against the
#     incoming changes. Anything overlapping needs a manual reconcile.
#
# Format: `<path> :: <phase> :: <short reason>`
# Sorted by path.

